  headed to the US on September 4, 2025. [Source: X Post.

  https://x.com/SkyMartiner/status/1977704432587399347]@SkyMartiner

  • SU-BTT made a stopover at Minot Air Force Base in North Dakota for about one
  hour on

  September 4, 2025, possibly for refueling or boarding military personnel.
  [Source: X Post.

  https://x.com/SkyMartiner/status/19777047941406680421@SkyMartiner

  • SU-BTT's first trip to America was on July 20, 2025, to an army base in
  Nebraska. [Source: X

  Post. https://x.com/RealCandaceO/status/1977168281456066960] @RealCandaceo

